<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E6%96%B9%E5%93%A8%E6%AD%8C\" title=\"北方哨歌\"><img alt=\"北方哨歌\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E6%96%B9%E5%93%A8%E6%AD%8C\" title=\"北方哨歌\">北方哨歌</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.5</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>旧卷新谈</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：307703</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能1</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3077/307703/技能1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3077/307703/技能1 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3077/307703/技能2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3077/307703/技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3077/307703/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3077/307703/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3077/307703/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3077/307703/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">“先祖弥留之际，曾向我索要一份美食，叫做玉屑饭。我问其中缘由，他便给我讲述了一则旧事。”<br />“他说年少时曾于月夜偶遇一道人。那人衣净如雪，风致高洁，自称是月宫的修月人。说着那人就解开包袱，取出玉屑饭，邀请祖父一起品尝。”<br />“我按照祖父所说，来到当年旧地，想要寻觅此饭，可问遍乡野，始终没有结果。我想到祖父时日无多，心下怅惘，就此归家。”<br />“回到祖父榻前，已是月上中天，祖父已安然逝去。枕头旁边有一个空碗，只见碗壁有数粒玉屑，发着淡淡的辉光。”</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"307703\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307706.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/6c/Belonging-307706.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“并不沉默的见证者”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Words Spoken\" Bamboo Slips</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />6<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一个看似普通的竹制书简，已陪伴受访者度过无数日夜，她将或简单、或复杂、或单薄、或沉重的见闻记录其中，连同无数仅存于镂刻之际的情绪。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/eb/Belonging-307704.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">青月如意<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Ruyi Scepter of the Green Moon</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />104<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>“我游遍奇山异水，也看惯了四时轮替。其中从来不变的，或许就只剩头顶这轮明月，以及手中这凿玉的物件儿。”受访者如是说。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/0b/Belonging-307705.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“圆满”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Satisfaction of the Full Moon\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一顶经月光晕染的帷帽。<br />每到夜晚，受访者便会撩起薄纱，欣赏被河水搅碎的明月。<br />“它出现在这儿，就已足够完满。”</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%BF%E7%8E%89%E8%AE%B01.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 凿玉记1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%BF%E7%8E%89%E8%AE%B01.jpg/203px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%BF%E7%8E%89%E8%AE%B01.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"203\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%BF%E7%8E%89%E8%AE%B01.jpg/305px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%BF%E7%8E%89%E8%AE%B01.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%BF%E7%8E%89%E8%AE%B01.jpg/406px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%BF%E7%8E%89%E8%AE%B01.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1200\" data-file-height=\"1920\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%BF%E7%8E%89%E8%AE%B02.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 凿玉记2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%BF%E7%8E%89%E8%AE%B02.jpg/203px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%BF%E7%8E%89%E8%AE%B02.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"203\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%BF%E7%8E%89%E8%AE%B02.jpg/305px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%BF%E7%8E%89%E8%AE%B02.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%BF%E7%8E%89%E8%AE%B02.jpg/406px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%BF%E7%8E%89%E8%AE%B02.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1200\" data-file-height=\"1920\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">凿玉记 <small style=\"color: grey\">Records from the Jade Hunt</small></span></span>"}}